,"rates.h.effective_from":"Uses the server's time zone. Must be in the future.","rates.h.end_inclusive":"The last night of the period is included.","rates.h.exclusive":"When it applies, no other promotion is combined with it.","rates.h.extra_code":"Short unique code, e.g. TRF for an airport transfer.","rates.h.extra_unit.PER_PERSON_SHARE":"Extra adults/children are priced from the room price divided by the included adults.","rates.h.extra_unit.ROOM_PRICE":"Extra adults/children are priced from the full room price.","rates.h.free_nights":"E.g. stay 7, pay 6: the cheapest night is free.","rates.h.from_age":"Inclusive, in years (3 = from the 3rd birthday).","rates.h.fx_adjustment":"Percentage (provider-rate mode with %) or a fixed amount in the target currency added to the provider rate.","rates.h.guaranteed":"Rooms are held for this contract until the release date, even if unsold.","rates.h.guest_text":"Shown in the booking engine and confirmation.","rates.h.included_adults":"Room basis only: how many adults the room price covers (0 = room type default).","rates.h.infants_count_as_occupants":"If off, infants do not use a bed place when checking room capacity.","rates.h.inventory_tracked":"Sell at most the daily capacity per day (e.g. spa slots). Stays already sold keep their units; see and change each day in Inventory → Extras. A mandatory extra cannot be limited.","rates.h.is_base":"The base room carries absolute prices; other rooms can be derived from it.","rates.h.is_infant":"Infants can be free on boards and do not always count as occupants.","rates.h.is_mandatory":"Added to every booking automatically (e.g. gala dinner).","rates.h.is_override":"Wins over every other rule for the same slot (highest precedence).","rates.h.locked_after_publish":"Locked: a version of this contract has been published.","rates.h.locked_fixed":"Fixed: this contract's versions were priced and sold on it.","rates.h.locked_versioned":"Set per version: change it in a draft version and publish it.","rates.h.manual_rate":"1 unit of the source currency = this many units of the target currency.","rates.h.market":"Guests of this market are sold this contract. Never assigned silently.","rates.h.markup_label":"Name shown in price explanations, e.g. “DACH direct +8 %”.","rates.h.markup_priority":"Only breaks ties between rules with exactly the same scope.","rates.h.max_age_days":"Refuse to convert with a provider rate older than this.","rates.h.max_lead_days":"Booked at most this many days before arrival (0 = no limit).","rates.h.member_only":"Only for logged-in loyalty members.","rates.h.min_adults":"0 = at least one adult.","rates.h.min_basket":"Minimum accommodation value (selling currency) before the promotion applies.","rates.h.min_lead_days":"Booked at least this many days before arrival (early booking).","rates.h.offer_code":"Unique within the contract, e.g. EB15.","rates.h.per_guest_limit":"How often one guest may use it (0 = unlimited).","rates.h.period_code":"Short code referenced by prices and rules, e.g. HIGH27.","rates.h.period_priority":"When periods overlap (e.g. a weekend period inside high season), the higher priority wins.","rates.h.plan_op":"Rate plan price relative to the contract price, e.g. −12 % for non-refundable.","rates.h.position":"1 = first adult/child, 2 = second … 0 = any position.","rates.h.preview_currency":"Converting needs an FX policy for the pair.","rates.h.preview_market":"Changes which markup and promotions apply; the contract stays the same.","rates.h.prices_include_tax":"If on, taxes are extracted from the prices instead of being added.","rates.h.pricing_basis":"Per person: a base person rate × occupancy rules. Per room: one price per room per night.","rates.h.promo_codes":"Comma separated, e.g. EARLY10.","rates.h.promo_group":"Promotions in the same group never combine; the best one is taken.","rates.h.promo_priority":"Higher priority is evaluated first.","rates.h.property_global":"Leave empty to apply to every hotel you manage.","rates.h.property_hotel":"The hotel this record belongs to.","rates.h.refundable":"Non-refundable policies charge 100 % on any cancellation.","rates.h.release_days":"Unsold rooms go back to general sale this many days before arrival.","rates.h.requires_extras":"Extra codes that must be booked too, comma separated (package deals).","rates.h.room_basis_children_fill_included":"E.g. 1 adult + 1 child in a room priced for 2: the child takes the free place.","rates.h.sale_at":"Price as if booked at this moment (versions, promotions and markup in force then). Empty = now.","rates.h.sale_vs_stay":"Sale dates limit when the booking is made; stay dates limit the nights of the stay.","rates.h.sell_currency":"Currency shown to guests; empty = contract currency.","rates.h.stackable":"May combine with other stackable promotions.","rates.h.stacking.ADDITIVE":"Percentages are added up and taken from the price before promotions.","rates.h.stacking.SEQUENTIAL":"Each promotion is taken from the price left after the previous one.","rates.h.stacking_rules":"Exclusive beats everything; promotions of the same incompatible group never combine; otherwise stackable ones combine in priority order.","rates.h.tax_currency":"Per person or per room night levies are charged in this currency and converted at the exchange rate of the sale time.","rates.h.to_age":"Exclusive: 2.99 and 3 both mean “until the 3rd birthday”.","rates.h.usage_limit":"Total redemptions across all guests (0 = unlimited).","rates.h.value_added":"What the guest gets, e.g. “Free airport transfer”.","rates.h.weekdays":"Only these weekdays belong to the period. None selected = every day.","rates.h.zero_no_limit":"0 = no limit.","rates.h.zero_room_type":"0 = use the room type's capacity.","rates.infant_pricing.CUSTOM":"Own price","rates.infant_pricing.FREE":"Free","rates.infant_pricing.SAME_AS_CHILD":"Same as child","rates.level.COMBINATION":"Combination","rates.level.CONTRACT":"Contract","rates.level.GLOBAL":"Global"